      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_4",
        on: "branch_if_4",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            condition: "hook",
            hook: "predicate:variable_compare",
            variable: "temp_merge_zombie_array[$i].allow_recruit",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "this_item.allow_recruit",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_3",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            side: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "this_item.side",
                value: 1,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_gold",
            side: 1,
            amount: "$rastabahn_gold",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variables",
            payload: "%7B%22name%22%3A%22temp_merge_zombie_array%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22replace%22%2C%22to_variable%22%3A%22%22%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22split%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22list%22%3A%22%24rastabahn_zombies%22%2C%22key%22%3A%22allow_recruit%22%2C%22separator%22%3A%22%2C%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "zombies",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:fire_event",
                event: "branch_if_4",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Shynal",
            unit: "Shynal",
            x: 13,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Corpse Shynal",
            unit: "Corpse Shynal",
            x: 13,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Carcyn",
            unit: "Carcyn",
            x: 14,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            facing: "sw",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            side: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            facing: "ne",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ardonna%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Ardonna",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_6",
        on: "branch_if_6",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "bird_bones_found",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Chocobone",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Ardonna",
            x: 12,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Bone Captain",
            unit: "Bone Captain",
            x: 12,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Vendraxis",
            unit: "Vendraxis",
            x: 13,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            facing: "ne",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Vendraxis%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Vendraxis",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Greetings Ardonna! (<i>Cough</i>) I was successful, and I see that you were as well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Well met, Ras-Tabahn. Yes I was. Now, can you explain the mission you spoke of?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Gladly. I assume you studied the great mage Crelanu in history class. He fought with King Haldric the First. Since he faced the immortal lords of the Green Isle directly, he undoubtedly knows more than we about their methods. Recently, I have learned where to find him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Of course I know about Crelanu. But can we force him to reveal his knowledge to us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("That shouldn’t be necessary. I have also learned that he wrote a book containing all his secrets, which must include all he knows of immortality. We need only borrow this book. I knew that getting that book was not something I could accomplish on my own, but now, with a force such as ours, it should be easily done."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Yes, that seems like a plan with a good chance of success. I will join you in your effort."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("I thought as much. We must cross the Great River, and head north into the Heart Mountains."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Possibly. When an Academy mage completes his studies, he is granted syllables of power, which become his new name. You are well beyond that point, but you are with the free magi now, so choose your own name. I was originally Rassin Tabin, but that is fairly ordinary, and at one point, it no longer suited."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("I suppose you are right. I am no longer the ordinary girl Ardonna, and Vendraxis was correct. From now on I shall be... Ardryn-Na."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            unit_name: "Ardryn-Na",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ardonna%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Ardonna",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Well then Ardryn-Na, let us head north."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
